  "solution": {
    "text": "\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{T}=\\mathrm{S}_1 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{x}(4)+\\mathrm{y}(3)-4(\\mathrm{x}+4)=16+9-32 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 3 \\mathrm{y}-9=0 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{y}=3\n\\end{aligned}\\)"
